ing-3.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":337326,"altZh":"F1荷兰大奖赛因维斯塔潘撞车被红旗中断"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.autosport.com/f1/news/dutch-f1-grand-prix-red-flagged-after-huge-max-verstappen-crash/10848603/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=uk","reason":null},"relatedSources":[{"publicId":"public-rss-0a986957951a396bed5759b11e81ffb10ac1c39553433f80d5243c2ddff310ed","sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","displayName":"Motorsport.com","originalUrl":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/dutch-f1-grand-prix-red-flagged-after-huge-max-verstappen-crash/10848600/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www"}]},{"publicId":"public-rss-a83adb53f45c0c5241e7c7a0978f35f7aaea9a5ccf4e4a0a86225cbbe9d6c8b5","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"罗斯伯格警告安东内利：F1冠军争夺战中的“心魔”","summaryZh":"2016年F1世界冠军尼科·罗斯伯格警告梅赛德斯车手、当前积分榜领跑者基米·安东内利，在争夺首个世界冠军的过程中将面临心理战。罗斯伯格在荷兰大奖赛前接受天空体育F1采访时，结合自己夺冠的经验，解释了安东内利在赛季后期可能遭遇的心理压力。","publishedAt":"2026-08-24T04:05:36.442Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-23T12:45:10.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/0R7we7o2/s6/andrea-kimi-antonelli-mercedes.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":241900,"altZh":"罗斯伯格警告安东内利：F1冠军争夺战中的“心魔”"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/nico-rosberg-warns-kimi-antonelli-of-f1-title-demons/10848584/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-b1527868e1506ecf636f1989fe88bc45bfc8effcf0f2973c8e34db95cd66920d","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"多梅尼卡利：无法想象F1没有维斯塔潘","summaryZh":"F1首席执行官斯特凡诺·多梅尼卡利对马克斯·维斯塔潘续约红牛表示乐观。四届世界冠军维斯塔